OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry and bright with sunny
OL,6,Fspells this morning, but increasingly
OL,7,Fbreezy. Cloud thickening and wind
OL,8,Fstrengthening during the afternoon
OL,9,Fwith outbreaks of rain, occasionally
OL,10,Fheavy, arriving late afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FWet and windy this evening
OL,13,Fwith rain, occasionally heavy,
OL,14,Fclearing by midnight. Drier with clear
OL,15,Fspells during the early hours, but
OL,16,Fremaining windy. Perhaps some showers
OL,17,Faround dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
