OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA mixture of sunny spells and
OL,6,Fshowers on Tuesday, these occasionally
OL,7,Fheavy and perhaps thundery. Still
OL,8,Fwindy, with a risk of gales for a time.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FSunny
OL,11,Fspells and isolated mainly coastal
OL,12,Fshowers Wednesday, wind easing. Dry
OL,13,Fstart Thursday, but breezy with rain
OL,14,Flater. Early rain Friday clearing.
OL,15,FTemperatures around average for early
OL,16,FSeptember.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
